    "publication_date": "2025-11-20",
    "description": "<p>This record contains the dataset used in the article:\"Litvin, D. et al. Flexible corneal neurotechnology reveals in-vivo pathological retinal oscillations in retinitis pigmentosa mouse models and patients as a biomarker of functional remodeling during retinal degeneration\".</p>\n<p>The Data.zip folder contains input data for PSD analysis, cycle-by-cycle (CBC) analyis and multi-metric (MM) anaylsis. for each analysis, it contains also expected results.</p>\n<p>The Analysis code is currently available here: https://github.com/lne-lab/rsERG</p>",
